save(340,dict(paragraphs=["Sangeeta Dey (Roy) is a poet and essayist from Haflong in Assam’s Dima Hasao district. Her publisher biography describes her work in teaching and her co-editing of the poetry anthology ‘Mystic Reveries’. Her collections include ‘Whispers in the Blue’, published by Blue Rose in 2024, and ‘Twilight in the Woodland’, published by WissenMonk.","Landscape becomes an intimate presence in her Kabita Live poems. ‘The Vapoury Spread of Jatinga’ follows fog, winding roads and cloud-covered hills into a sense of welcome, while the poem presented under ‘Haflong’ turns midnight shadows into companions of inward reflection. ‘The Cycle’ questions the damage done by an inflated sense of self; ‘Sign Off’ considers the exhaustion concealed beneath outward warmth. These poems move between close observation of place and the emotional costs of human relationships."],books=[dict(title='Whispers in the Blue',detail='Poetry · Blue Rose Publishers, 2024',url='https://play.google.com/store/books/details/Sangeeta_Dey_Whispers_in_the_Blue?id=LiHuEAAAQBAJ'),dict(title='Twilight in the Woodland',detail='Poetry · WissenMonk',url='https://www.wissenmonk.com/product-page/twilight-in-the-woodland')],sources=[source('Blue Rose: Whispers in the Blue and author biography on Google Play','https://play.google.com/store/books/details/Sangeeta_Dey_Whispers_in_the_Blue?id=LiHuEAAAQBAJ','Publisher, year, Haflong identity, teaching and co-editing Mystic Reveries.','search_index_direct_open_failed'),source('WissenMonk: Twilight in the Woodland','https://www.wissenmonk.com/product-page/twilight-in-the-woodland','Publisher book listing and two-part nature/life structure.'),source('Yugen Quest Review: Sangeeta Dey (Roy)','https://weliterarydynamic.wordpress.com/sangeeta-dey-roys-poem-in-yqr-spring-summer-25-edition/','Both collection titles, Haflong/Dima Hasao identity and teacher biography.','search_index_direct_open_failed')],identity_match='Exact debut title, full Dey/Roy name, Haflong/Dima Hasao and teaching context match capture; journal independently lists both collections.',poems_read=[dict(id=i,title=t,coverage='Full original read.',basis=b) for i,t,b in [(417,'THE VAPOURY SPREAD OF JATINGA','Fog/roads/clouds/Barial hills and sensory welcome.'),(501,'THE VAPOURY SPREAD OF JATINGA','Repeated poem with spacing differences; preserved as separate issue appearance.'),(556,'SIGN OFF','Outward smile/warmth versus exhaustion and unreciprocated repair.'),(557,'PRIDE IMPRISONED','Storm arrogance confronted by faith and rain.'),(741,'THE CYCLE','Ego I/zero O, damaged landscapes and homes.'),(760,'Haflong','Body opens My midnight story; shadows accompany introspection and dreams.')]],limitations=['417 and501 are repeated issue appearances with minor spacing differences; not merged.','760 heading Haflong differs from opening My midnight story; preserved, no retitling.','Apple ebook listing gives May2024 while Google Play gives January2024; only year used.','Publication notices calling both collections debut books are not repeated.','No award claims or personal spiritual beliefs inferred from poems.'],next_action='Independent author/editor review; confirm poem760 title and repeated417/501 appearances.'))
